  "content": "\n\n<h1>🔄 默认游戏模式 🎮</h1>\n<p>此模组允许你在创建新世界时更改默认世界游戏模式（生存、极限、创造、旁观者）。它不会改变已有世界的游戏模式！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_64h.png\" alt=\"Fabric\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fquiltmc.org%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/quilt_64h.png\" alt=\"Quilt\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Alfakynz/Default-Gamemode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/github_64h.png\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fidPolUDF\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/default-gamemode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_64h.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/TcmUQHZ5U4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_64h.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<h2>✨ 功能特性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>创建新世界时更改默认游戏模式</li>\n<li>支持所有游戏模式：生存、极限、创造和旁观者</li>\n<li>包含设置项，可配置将哪种游戏模式设为默认值（需配合 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmOgUt4GM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModMenu</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252f9s6osm5g\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a>）</li>\n<li>兼容 <a href=\"https://github.com/Keksuccino/ModernWorldCreation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modern World Creation</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🔄 版本要求</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minecraft &gt;= 1.20</li>\n<li>Fabric &gt;= 0.16.4</li>\n<li>Quilt &gt;= 0.17.3</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🚀 计划中的功能</h2>\n<p>目前暂无计划，但欢迎随时提出你想要的功能建议！</p>\n<h2>📦 整合包</h2>\n<p>欢迎在整合包中使用 Better Slots。</p>\n<h2>🌐 寻找服务器？顺便支持一下我！</h2>\n<p>想和朋友一起玩？通过 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252fwildlight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wabbanode</a> 搭建你自己的服务器。</p>\n<p>使用优惠码 <strong>WILDLIGHT</strong> 支持我，并享受八折优惠。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252fwildlight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/hvk4z0Vv/banner-3.png\" alt=\"Wabbanode 服务器\"></a></p>",
